<h3>A.3 — Development Phases &amp; Todos</h3>
<h4>Phase 1 — Foundation &amp; Auth (Immediate)</h4>
<ol>
<li>Fix YouVersion redirect URI mismatch.</li>
<li>Add Firebase email sign-up / registration UI.</li>
<li>Confirm YouVersion sign-in works on web and Android WebView.</li>
<li>Wrap YouVersion SDK + REST behind a <code>BibleService</code> adapter.</li>
</ol>

<h4>Phase 2 — Data &amp; Offline (Next)</h4>
<ol>
<li>Implement service worker and offline KJV cache.</li>
<li>Add reading progress and last-location persistence.</li>
<li>Build canonical USFM / reference layer and versification mapping.</li>
<li>Expand places and characters with licensed/expanded data.</li>
</ol>

<h4>Phase 3 — Graph &amp; Search (Next)</h4>
<ol>
<li>Replace term-similarity cross-references with a real cross-reference dataset.</li>
<li>Persist the Scripture Graph in a graph-capable store or structured JSON.</li>
<li>Add semantic / embedding search (backend or API).</li>
<li>Evolve the 3D network into the RiC Scripture Graph / Hyperlink Matrix.</li>
</ol>

<h4>Phase 4 — AI &amp; Advanced Features (Future)</h4>
<ol>
<li>Design RAG pipeline over the Scripture Graph + local data.</li>
<li>Build the AI study companion with grounded answers.</li>
<li>Integrate YouVersion Data Exchange for bookmarks/highlights where permitted.</li>
<li>Polish mobile native UX (deep links, audio, offline).</li>
</ol>

