<h3>A.5 — Living Architecture v1.0 (Target)</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>UI layer:</strong> React/Vite components, now split by feature (Search, Reader, Network, Map, Lexicon, Settings) instead of monolithic <code>App.tsx</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Application services:</strong> <code>BibleService</code> (abstracts YouVersion SDK/REST + offline KJV), <code>UserDataService</code> (local + Firestore + YouVersion Data Exchange), <code>SearchService</code> (local + API), <code>GraphService</code> (Scripture Graph).</li>
<li><strong>Data layer:</strong> local JSON cache (KJV, places, characters), YouVersion API, Firestore, IndexedDB, and a future graph store / structured JSON.</li>
<li><strong>Auth:</strong> Firebase email/password + YouVersion OAuth, with unified user identity.</li>
<li><strong>Mobile:</strong> Capacitor WebView initially; evaluate native auth deep links later.</li>
<li><strong>AI:</strong> RAG pipeline over local + graph data; optional LLM API for natural-language study help.</li>
</ul>

